-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":33,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/CzyfbgdKblUOwDRKKILCmpQ42D.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/CzyfbgdKblUOwDRKKILCmpQ42D.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68007/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1226353","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"世界再生の旅は、終着地点・救いの塔へと臨む。既に感覚の殆どを失ったコレットは、最後に残された「心」と「記憶」を捧げる決意をする。天使に生まれ変わることはすなわち、人としての死を意味していた。非情ともいえるこの世界の法則――衰退世界シルヴァラントは、神子の死を以って救われる…。世界再生という大儀と、コレットへの想いの間で選択を迫られるロイド達。そんな中、地下組織レネゲードを名乗る男・ユアンが現れ、神子の天使化を阻止するという……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":34,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/chpMM1VEID8dSbwdkWbJcW6ehoW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/chpMM1VEID8dSbwdkWbJcW6ehoW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68007/season/1/episode/4"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68007/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793441784807,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793441784807,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793441784807,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793441784807,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}}}
